71 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 59 0 R
/E (Essentially, this means offering more than one way to take in information \(video, text, hands-on demo\), more than one way for students to show what they know \(writing, speaking, building, drawing\), and more than one way to stay motivated \(choice, relevance, varied levels of challenge\))
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
>>
