/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 59 0 R
/E (The strength-based model is an approach to working with students that starts by identifying what a student is good at, interested in, and motivated by. It uses those as the foundation for teaching, rather than starting from a list of problems to fix.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
