<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 59 0 R
/E (Various research on the strength-based model has found that when teachers focus on student strengths, engagement rises, relationships improve, and academic outcomes strengthen, particularly for neurodivergent learners. \(Elmbridge University\))
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [9]
>>
